{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0001", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "阴脉小弱、渴不能食、无寒热而仅恶恶心，古法诊为妊娠（早孕）。", "entity_ids": ["symptom.e_xin"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "恶心", "seg_from": 21, "seg_to": 21, "start_s": 122.49, "end_s": 132.81, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=122s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 122.49, "end_s": 132.81}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "此脉/吃小弱=阴脉小弱", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0002", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "不孕无固定专方；随现证用经方调理（便秘大柴胡、喘麻黄类、疮十二甘草等），常意外得孕；温经汤仅适用于合其证者。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wen_jing_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "温经汤", "seg_from": 28, "seg_to": 28, "start_s": 167.17, "end_s": 174.425, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=167s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 167.17, "end_s": 174.43}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0003", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "妊娠初两月有恶阻样不适，用桂枝汤调和阴阳、护正气，为安胎起步方。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "桂枝汤", "seg_from": 40, "seg_to": 40, "start_s": 228.33, "end_s": 232.405, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=228s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 228.33, "end_s": 232.41}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0004", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "不知是孕而误攻下（如大黄甘草汤、盐汤探吐）可致择药绝医或流产，妊娠忌妄下。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "大黄甘草汤", "seg_from": 48, "seg_to": 48, "start_s": 281.37, "end_s": 303.49, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=281s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 281.37, "end_s": 303.49}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "择绝肢=谢绝医药/流产", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0005", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "妇人常态左手（血）脉大于右手（气）；右大于左（气旺血弱）则不易孕，因胎赖血养。", "entity_ids": [], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c01", "evidence_quote": "左边是血", "seg_from": 51, "seg_to": 51, "start_s": 321.73, "end_s": 338.625, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=321s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 321.73, "end_s": 338.62}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0006", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "补合谷泻三阴交可泻胎堕胎；泻合谷补三阴交则安胎——以气血压泻助记。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4", "acupoint.sp6"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c02", "evidence_quote": "合谷", "seg_from": 55, "seg_to": 58, "start_s": 366.01, "end_s": 379.47, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=366s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 366.01, "end_s": 379.47}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "三幺=三阴交；卸台=堕胎", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0007", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "停经前三月月经准时者多属胎；经乱后停、嗣后下黑血块者多属癥瘕而非孕。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_fu_ling_wan"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c03", "evidence_quote": "前三月", "seg_from": 106, "seg_to": 106, "start_s": 704.99, "end_s": 711.455, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=704s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 704.99, "end_s": 711.46}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0008", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "桂枝茯苓丸专消胞中癥积肌瘤：寒水停瘀；非癌。桂枝导心火下焦祛寒，茯苓去水，桃仁化瘀，芍药治腹痛。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_fu_ling_wan", "herb.gui_zhi", "herb.fu_ling", "herb.tao_ren", "herb.shao_yao"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c03", "evidence_quote": "桂枝茯苓丸", "seg_from": 108, "seg_to": 108, "start_s": 713.74, "end_s": 721.21, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=713s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 713.74, "end_s": 721.21}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-021.kp0009", "video_id": "jgy-021", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "癥寒实盛时，桂枝茯苓丸中可等量加生附子与硫黄以破寒去水。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_fu_ling_wan", "herb.fu_zi"], "chapter_id": "jgy-021.c03", "evidence_quote": "生附子", "seg_from": 125, "seg_to": 125, "start_s": 813.44, "end_s": 815.9, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z4o9zRl7AUM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z4o9zRl7AUM&t=813s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 21, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 20婦人妊娠病", "start_s": 813.44, "end_s": 815.9}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "硫磺=硫黄", "source": "llm_read"}
